			"id": "link-adb32511bfb59f417ad94b694a6d3177",
			"title": "HackerTube: YouTube built from videos recommended by HN",
			"link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50319510",
			"contents": "<div class=\"Story_container\"><div class=\"Story_data\"><div class=\"Story_title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50319510\"><span>HackerTube: YouTube built from videos recommended by HN</span></a><a href=\"https://karpathy.bearblog.dev/hacker-tube/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"Story_link\">(https://karpathy.bearblog.dev/hacker-tube/)</a></div><div class=\"Story_meta\"><span><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50319510\">2881 points</a></span><span class=\"Story_separator\">|</span><span><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=karpathy\"><span>karpathy</span></a></span><span class=\"Story_separator\">|</span><span><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50319510\">4 days ago</a></span><span class=\"Story_separator\">|</span><span><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50319510\">637 comments</a></span><div class=\"Story_comment\"><span>YouTube-style UI over 6,454 videos sourced from 39,834 HN comments since 2007.<p><a href=\"https://hackertube.org/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://hackertube.org/</a></p></span></div></div></div></div>",
